    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is Mark.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452240/extras/173143252e8f18687e6fe2b1fd24d11f.avif?t=1698176734\" /></span><br><br>And that's about it. Every time he hits a side of your screen, he rebounds, and speeds up <i>just a little bit</i>.<br><br>Sometimes, however, <strong>he hits the exact corner</strong> in a satisfying bounce. That's a signal to stop the work you're supposed to be doing, and <strong>play a little game with Mark</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452240/extras/d26d3acf0b6e24e3e8c872393f5467c7.avif?t=1698176734\" /></span><br><br><strong>Hit the corner?</strong> Procrastinate easily with 10 small minigames that are just fun enough to take your mind off your work.<br><br>From classics like Snake, sneaking through mazes, skydiving, chess and even beating up your brother, Desktop Mark has just what you need to scratch your entertainment itch!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452240/extras/16ad57e892e740dfe2a31386f182db44.avif?t=1698176734\" /></span><br><br>Every minigame earns you Mark bucks, which you can then use to <strong>customise Mark with over 25 Marks, 40 hats and 10 corner-hit sounds.</strong><br><br><strong>Make Mark your own, earn achievements and play games.</strong> Yeah, that's Desktop Mark.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAQ</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Does he bounce around your real computer?</strong> <u>Yes</u>! He's always on top and transparent, so you can do anything else whilst he bounces.<br></li><li> <strong>How often does he hit the corner?</strong> Depending on what you've got the acceleration set to, around <u>every 15 minutes</u>.<br></li><li> <strong>Do I need to have a corner hit to play minigames?</strong> <u>Nope!</u> For a small amount of Mark bucks, you can play any minigame at any time, and even profit!<br></li><li> <strong>How many hours of gameplay will I get?</strong> Don't expect hours of content. <u>Depending on how you play,</u> you can have Mark as a simple distraction widget or grind minigames to buy every costume you can.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is Mark.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452240/extras/173143252e8f18687e6fe2b1fd24d11f.avif?t=1698176734\" /></span><br><br>And that's about it. Every time he hits a side of your screen, he rebounds, and speeds up <i>just a little bit</i>.<br><br>Sometimes, however, <strong>he hits the exact corner</strong> in a satisfying bounce. That's a signal to stop the work you're supposed to be doing, and <strong>play a little game with Mark</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452240/extras/d26d3acf0b6e24e3e8c872393f5467c7.avif?t=1698176734\" /></span><br><br><strong>Hit the corner?</strong> Procrastinate easily with 10 small minigames that are just fun enough to take your mind off your work.<br><br>From classics like Snake, sneaking through mazes, skydiving, chess and even beating up your brother, Desktop Mark has just what you need to scratch your entertainment itch!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452240/extras/16ad57e892e740dfe2a31386f182db44.avif?t=1698176734\" /></span><br><br>Every minigame earns you Mark bucks, which you can then use to <strong>customise Mark with over 25 Marks, 40 hats and 10 corner-hit sounds.</strong><br><br><strong>Make Mark your own, earn achievements and play games.</strong> Yeah, that's Desktop Mark.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAQ</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Does he bounce around your real computer?</strong> <u>Yes</u>! He's always on top and transparent, so you can do anything else whilst he bounces.<br></li><li> <strong>How often does he hit the corner?</strong> Depending on what you've got the acceleration set to, around <u>every 15 minutes</u>.<br></li><li> <strong>Do I need to have a corner hit to play minigames?</strong> <u>Nope!</u> For a small amount of Mark bucks, you can play any minigame at any time, and even profit!<br></li><li> <strong>How many hours of gameplay will I get?</strong> Don't expect hours of content. <u>Depending on how you play,</u> you can have Mark as a simple distraction widget or grind minigames to buy every costume you can.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Desktop Mark is a simple minigame-centric idler revolving around the silly character of Mark, a smiley that bounces all around your screen. Every so often, Mark hits the corner and prompts you to procrastinate &amp; have some fun with Mark.",
